window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch232","pages":[{"n":1711,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"115\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">112<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return err;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">113<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">114<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 导出__mdiobus_register 函数，供其他内核模块使用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">115<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">EXPORT_SYMBOL(__mdiobus_register);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1711 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1711\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单231.5 中，配置设备的父设备、类（设为&amp;mdio_bus_class）及属性组（设为NULL），并使用总线ID 命名设备。临时将总线状态设为MDIOBUS_UNREGISTERED。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第30 行代码调用device_register()函数将MDIO 总线设备注册到内核设备模型。第43 行代码调用devm_gpiod_get_optional()函数获取复位GPIO。若获取成功，先将其设为高电平，经过bus-&gt;reset_delay_us 微秒延时后，再设为低电平进行复位。如果mii_bus 结构体中定义了复位函数reset，调用此函数对MDIO 总线进行复位。接着遍历0 到PHY_MAX_ADDR 的PHY地址。对于每个地址，第72 行代码调用mdiobus_scan()函数扫描PHY 设备。第84 行代码接着调用mdiobus_setup_mdiodev_from_board_info()函数，根据设备树或板级信息设置MDIO 设备，并通过mdiobus_create_device()函数创建MDIO 设备实例。若上述流程顺利，将MDIO 总线状态设为MDIOBUS_REGISTERED，并打印调试信息表明注册完成。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1314\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第232 章PHY 芯片注册流程与匹配流程分析<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章分析PHY 芯片的注册流程。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">打开内核源码下kernel/drivers/net/phy/phy_device.c 文件，如代码清单232.1 所示。其中subsys_initcall 宏用于在系统初始化阶段调用phy_init()函数，module_exit 宏用于指定模块卸载时调用phy_exit()函数。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.1<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"4\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// subsys_initcall 宏用于在系统初始化阶段调用phy_init 函数，启动PHY 相关子系统的初始化<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">subsys_initcall(phy_init);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// module_exit 宏用于指定模块卸载时调用phy_exit 函数，清理PHY 相关资源<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">module_exit(phy_exit);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1711 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1711\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单232.1 中第2 行的phy_init()函数原型如代码清单232.2 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.2<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"2\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 定义phy_init 函数，用于初始化PHY 相关的子系统，该函数在系统初始化阶段被调用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int __init phy_init(void) {<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1711 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1711\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1712,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"3\" data-end=\"30\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int rc;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化MDIO 总线，mdio_bus_init 函数负责初始化MDIO 总线相关的资源和数据结构<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        rc = mdio_bus_init();<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果MDIO 总线初始化失败，直接返回错误码<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (rc)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return rc;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 注册10G 通用PHY 驱动，THIS_MODULE 表示当前模块<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        rc = phy_driver_register(&amp;genphy_10g_driver, THIS_MODULE);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果10G 通用PHY 驱动注册失败，跳转到err_10g 标签处进行错误处理<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (rc)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            goto err_10g;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 注册通用PHY 驱动<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        rc = phy_driver_register(&amp;genphy_driver, THIS_MODULE);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果通用PHY 驱动注册失败<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (rc) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 先注销已注册的10G 通用PHY 驱动<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phy_driver_unregister(&amp;genphy_10g_driver);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    err_10g:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 执行MDIO 总线的退出操作，清理MDIO 总线相关的资源<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            mdio_bus_exit();<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 返回最终的执行结果，0 表示成功，非0 表示失败<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return rc;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1712 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1712\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单232.2 中第6 行调用mdio_bus_init()函数来初始化MDIO 总线。mdio_bus_init()函数实现如代码清单232.3 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.3<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 定义mdio_bus_init 函数，用于初始化MDIO 总线子系统，__init 表示该函数仅在初始化阶段使用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int __init mdio_bus_init(void) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 注册mdio_bus_class 类，class_register 函数用于向内核注册一个新的类<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = class_register(&amp;mdio_bus_class);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果类注册成功（ret 为0）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!ret) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 注册mdio_bus_type 总线，bus_register 函数用于向内核注册一个新的总线类型<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            ret = bus_register(&amp;mdio_bus_type);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 如果总线注册失败<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            if (ret) {<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1712 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1712\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1713,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"22\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                // 注销之前注册成功的mdio_bus_class 类，class_unregister 用于从内核注销一个类<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                class_unregister(&amp;mdio_bus_class);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 返回最终的操作结果，0 表示成功，非0 表示失败<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 将mdio_bus_init 函数导出，供其他遵循GPL 协议的内核模块使用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(mdio_bus_init);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1713 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1713\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单232.3 中第6 行代码通过class_register()函数注册mdio_bus_class 类，这个类用于对MDIO 总线上的设备进行分类。如果类注册成功，第10 行代码接着使用bus_register()函数注册mdio_bus_type 总线。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接着分析代码清单232.2 中第18 行代码，在初始化MDIO 总线之后，使用phy_driver_register(&amp;genphy_driver, THIS_MODULE)函数注册PHY 驱动到MDIO 总线中。genphy_driver 结构体如代码清单232.4 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.4<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"14\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static struct phy_driver genphy_driver = {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .phy_id        = 0xffffffff,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .phy_id_mask    = 0xffffffff,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .name        = &quot;Generic PHY&quot;,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .soft_reset     = genphy_no_soft_reset,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .config_init    = genphy_config_init,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .features       = PHY_GBIT_FEATURES | SUPPORTED_MII |<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                         SUPPORTED_AUI | SUPPORTED_FIBRE |<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                         SUPPORTED_BNC,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .aneg_done      = genphy_aneg_done,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .suspend        = genphy_suspend,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .resume        = genphy_resume,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        .set_loopback   = genphy_loopback,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1713 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1713\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">上个章节代码清单232.5 中第72 行代码调用mdiobus_scan() 函数扫描PHY 设备，mdiobus_scan()函数实现如代码清单232.4 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.4<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"5\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// mdiobus_scan 函数用于在指定的MDIO 总线上扫描特定地址的PHY 设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 参数bus 指向MDIO 总线结构体，addr 为要扫描的PHY 设备地址<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct phy_device *mdiobus_scan(struct mii_bus *bus, int addr) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct phy_device *phydev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int err;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1713 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1713\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1714,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"6\" data-end=\"33\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 通过get_phy_device 函数获取指定地址的PHY 设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 这里false 表示假设该PHY 设备不使用802.3 - c45 协议<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        phydev = get_phy_device(bus, addr, false);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果获取设备过程出错（返回值为错误指针），直接返回该错误指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (IS_ERR(phydev))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return phydev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        /*<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 对于设备树（DT）相关操作，检查自动探测到的PHY 设备在总线节点中是否有对应的子节点，<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 如果有，则设置phydev 中mdio 成员的of_node 指针。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 这一步有助于将设备树中的信息与PHY 设备关联起来，方便后续基于设备树的配置和操作。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_mdiobus_link_mdiodev(bus, &amp;phydev-&gt;mdio);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 注册获取到的PHY 设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        err = phy_device_register(phydev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果注册过程出错<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (err) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 释放之前获取的PHY 设备资源<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phy_device_free(phydev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 返回设备不存在的错误指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return ERR_PTR(-ENODEV);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果一切顺利，返回注册成功的PHY 设备指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return phydev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1714 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1714\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单232.4 中第9 行代码通过get_phy_device()函数获取指定地址的PHY 设备，get_phy_device()函数实现如代码清单232.5 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.5<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"11\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// get_phy_device 函数用于获取指定MDIO 总线上特定地址的PHY 设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 参数bus 为MDIO 总线结构体指针，addr 是PHY 设备在总线上的地址，is_c45 表示该PHY 设备是否使用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">802.3 - c45 协议<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct phy_device *get_phy_device(struct mii_bus *bus, int addr, bool is_c45) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化一个用于存储802.3 - c45 协议设备ID 信息的结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct phy_c45_device_ids c45_ids = {0};<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 用于存储读取到的PHY 设备ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        u32 phy_id = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int r;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 调用get_phy_id 函数获取PHY 设备的ID<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1714 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1714\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1715,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"12\" data-end=\"29\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 根据is_c45 的值决定是按照802.3 - c45 协议还是常规方式获取ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 获取到的ID 存储在phy_id 中，c45_ids 用于存储802.3 - c45 协议相关的设备ID 信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        r = get_phy_id(bus, addr, &amp;phy_id, is_c45, &amp;c45_ids);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果获取ID 过程出错（返回值非0），返回错误指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (r)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return ERR_PTR(r);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果获取到的phy_id 大部分位为F（表示可能没有设备存在）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if ((phy_id &amp; 0x1fffffff) == 0x1fffffff)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 返回设备不存在的错误指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return ERR_PTR(-ENODEV);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 使用获取到的信息创建并返回phy_device 结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 该结构体代表了PHY 设备，包含设备的各种属性和状态信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return phy_device_create(bus, addr, phy_id, is_c45, &amp;c45_ids);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 导出get_phy_device 函数，供其他内核模块使用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">EXPORT_SYMBOL(get_phy_device);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1715 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1715\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单232.5 中第26 行代码调用phy_device_create()函数创建了一个代表PHY 设备的phy_device 结构体实例，phy_device_create()函数实现如代码清单232.6 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.6<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"20\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// 创建并初始化一个phy_device 结构体实例，用于表示MDIO 总线上的PHY 设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct phy_device *phy_device_create(struct mii_bus *bus, int addr, int phy_id,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                                        bool is_c45,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                                        struct phy_c45_device_ids *c45_ids) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct phy_device *dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct mdio_device *mdiodev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 分配phy_device 结构体的内存空间，并初始化为0<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev = kzalloc(sizeof(*dev), GFP_KERNEL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!dev)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return ERR_PTR(-ENOMEM);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 获取phy_device 结构体中的mdio_device 子结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev = &amp;dev-&gt;mdio;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 的父设备为MDIO 总线设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;dev.parent = &amp;bus-&gt;dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 所属的总线类型为mdio_bus_type<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;dev.bus = &amp;mdio_bus_type;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 的设备类型为mdio_bus_phy_type<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;dev.type = &amp;mdio_bus_phy_type;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1715 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1715\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1716,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"64\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 所属的总线为传入的bus<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;bus = bus;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置设备与驱动匹配时使用的函数为phy_bus_match<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;bus_match = phy_bus_match;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 在总线上的地址<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;addr = addr;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 的标志为MDIO_DEVICE_FLAG_PHY，表示这是一个PHY 设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;flags = MDIO_DEVICE_FLAG_PHY;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 释放时调用的函数为phy_mdio_device_free<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;device_free = phy_mdio_device_free;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置mdio_device 移除时调用的函数为phy_mdio_device_remove<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mdiodev-&gt;device_remove = phy_mdio_device_remove;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化phy_device 的速度为未知<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;speed = SPEED_UNKNOWN;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化phy_device 的双工模式为未知<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;duplex = DUPLEX_UNKNOWN;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化phy_device 的暂停功能为未启用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;pause = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化phy_device 的不对称暂停功能为未启用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;asym_pause = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化phy_device 的链路状态为未连接<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;link = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化phy_device 的接口模式为GMII（Gigabit Media Independent Interface）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;interface = PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_GMII;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 启用phy_device 的自动协商功能<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;autoneg = AUTONEG_ENABLE;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置phy_device 是否遵循802.3 - c45 协议<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;is_c45 = is_c45;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置phy_device 的标识符<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;phy_id = phy_id;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果传入了c45_ids 结构体指针，则复制其中的802.3 - c45 协议相关设备ID 信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (c45_ids)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            dev-&gt;c45_ids = *c45_ids;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置phy_device 的中断号，从MDIO 总线的中断信息数组中获取对应地址的中断号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;irq = bus-&gt;irq[addr];<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 根据PHY_ID_FMT 格式，结合总线ID 和设备地址为mdio_device 设置名称<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_set_name(&amp;mdiodev-&gt;dev, PHY_ID_FMT, bus-&gt;id, addr);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置phy_device 的状态为PHY_DOWN，表示设备当前处于未启动或未就绪状态<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev-&gt;state = PHY_DOWN;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1716 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1716\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1717,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"83\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化互斥锁，用于保护对phy_device 结构体中共享资源的访问<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mutex_init(&amp;dev-&gt;lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化延迟工作队列state_queue，关联phy_state_machine 函数，用于在未来某个时间点执行<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">该函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        INIT_DELAYED_WORK(&amp;dev-&gt;state_queue, phy_state_machine);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化工作队列phy_queue，关联phy_change_work 函数，用于执行该函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        INIT_WORK(&amp;dev-&gt;phy_queue, phy_change_work);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 无条件请求加载与PHY 设备ID 对应的内核模块<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        request_module(MDIO_MODULE_PREFIX MDIO_ID_FMT, MDIO_ID_ARGS(phy_id));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 初始化mdio_device 的设备结构体，设置一些默认的设备属性和操作函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        device_initialize(&amp;mdiodev-&gt;dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 返回创建并初始化好的phy_device 结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 导出phy_device_create 函数，供其他内核模块使用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">EXPORT_SYMBOL(phy_device_create);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1717 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1717\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单232.6 中第24 行代码调用phy_bus_match()函数，phy_bus_match()函数是MDIO总线匹配函数，函数实现如代码清单232.7 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.7<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"18\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// phy_bus_match 函数用于判断MDIO 总线上的设备（phy_device）与驱动（phy_driver）是否匹配<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// dev: 指向设备结构体的指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// drv: 指向设备驱动结构体的指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int phy_bus_match(struct device *dev, struct device_driver *drv) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 将传入的设备结构体指针转换为phy_device 结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct phy_device *phydev = to_phy_device(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 将传入的设备驱动结构体指针转换为phy_driver 结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct phy_driver *phydrv = to_phy_driver(drv);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 获取phydev 中存储的c45 设备ID 数组的大小<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        const int num_ids = ARRAY_SIZE(phydev-&gt;c45_ids.device_ids);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int i;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果驱动的mdiodrv 标志中不包含MDIO_DEVICE_IS_PHY，说明该驱动不是针对PHY 设备的，<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">直接返回0（不匹配）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!(phydrv-&gt;mdiodrv.flags &amp; MDIO_DEVICE_IS_PHY))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">       // 如果驱动提供了match_phy_device 函数，调用该函数来判断设备与驱动是否匹配，并返回结果<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1717 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1717\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1718,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"45\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (phydrv-&gt;match_phy_device)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return phydrv-&gt;match_phy_device(phydev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果phy_device 是遵循802.3 - c45 协议的设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (phydev-&gt;is_c45) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 遍历c45 设备ID 数组（从索引1 开始，因为索引0 可能有特殊用途）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            for (i = 1; i &lt; num_ids; i++) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                // 如果当前设备ID 在package 中的标志位未设置，跳过该ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                if (!(phydev-&gt;c45_ids.devices_in_package &amp; (1 &lt;&lt; i)))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                    continue;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                // 检查驱动的phy_id 与当前设备ID 在经过掩码处理后是否相等<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                if ((phydrv-&gt;phy_id &amp; phydrv-&gt;phy_id_mask) ==<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                    (phydev-&gt;c45_ids.device_ids[i] &amp; phydrv-&gt;phy_id_mask))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                    // 如果相等，说明设备与驱动匹配，返回1<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                    return 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 遍历完所有ID 后都不匹配，返回0<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        } else {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 如果phy_device 不是遵循802.3 - c45 协议的设备，直接比较驱动的phy_id 和设备的phy_id<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">经过掩码处理后是否相等<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return (phydrv-&gt;phy_id &amp; phydrv-&gt;phy_id_mask) ==<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                   (phydev-&gt;phy_id &amp; phydrv-&gt;phy_id_mask);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1718 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1718\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单232.7 中第6 行将传入的设备结构体指针转换为phy_device 结构体指针。第8行将传入的设备驱动结构体指针转换为phy_driver 结构体指针。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第31-34 行检查驱动的phy_id 与当前设备ID 在经过掩码处理后是否相等，如果相等说明PHY 设备和PHY 驱动匹配，匹配成功之后调用phy_probe()函数，phy_probe()函数实现如代码清单232.8 所示：<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单232.8<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"9\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int phy_probe(struct device *dev) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 将传入的设备结构体指针转换为phy_device 结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct phy_device *phydev = to_phy_device(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 获取phy_device 结构体中mdio 设备的驱动结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct device_driver *drv = phydev-&gt;mdio.dev.driver;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 将设备驱动结构体指针转换为phy_driver 结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct phy_driver *phydrv = to_phy_driver(drv);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int err = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1718 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1718\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1719,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"10\" data-end=\"53\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 将phy_driver 结构体指针赋值给phy_device 的drv 成员，建立设备与驱动的关联<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        phydev-&gt;drv = phydrv;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 如果PHY 驱动不支持中断，但中断仍然有效，<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 则将PHY 设备的中断模式设置为轮询（PHY_POLL）<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!(phydrv-&gt;flags &amp; PHY_HAS_INTERRUPT) &amp;&amp;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phy_interrupt_is_valid(phydev))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phydev-&gt;irq = PHY_POLL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果驱动标志表明该PHY 是内部设备，则设置phydev 的is_internal 标志为true<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (phydrv-&gt;flags &amp; PHY_IS_INTERNAL)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phydev-&gt;is_internal = true;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 锁定互斥锁，以保护对phy_device 共享资源的访问<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mutex_lock(&amp;phydev-&gt;lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 初始时，假设设备支持驱动所具备的所有特性。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 最终，当一个控制器连接时，可能会修改这些值中的一个或两个。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        phydev-&gt;supported = phydrv-&gt;features;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 根据设备树信息设置设备支持的特性<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_set_phy_supported(phydev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 设置设备的广告能力为其支持的特性<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        phydev-&gt;advertising = phydev-&gt;supported;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* 获取我们想要禁止的EEE（Energy Efficient Ethernet）模式。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 稍后我们将要求PHY 停止通告这些模式<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        of_set_phy_eee_broken(phydev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        /* Pause Frame 位表示PHY 可以支持传递暂停帧。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 在自动协商期间，PHY 将确定是否应允许传递暂停帧。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * MAC 驱动应使用该结果来确定是否通过暂停帧启用流控制。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         *<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 通常，PHY 驱动不应设置Pause 位，而是让phylib 来处理。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         * 然而，在某些情况下（例如硬件错误），驱动可能只想设置其中一位。<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">         */<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (phydrv-&gt;features &amp; (SUPPORTED_Pause | SUPPORTED_Asym_Pause)) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 如果驱动支持暂停或不对称暂停特性，<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 则从设备支持的特性中移除默认的暂停和不对称暂停特性，<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 然后添加驱动所支持的暂停和不对称暂停特性<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phydev-&gt;supported &amp;= ~(SUPPORTED_Pause | SUPPORTED_Asym_Pause);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phydev-&gt;supported |= phydrv-&gt;features &amp;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1719 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1719\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1720,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"84\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                                (SUPPORTED_Pause | SUPPORTED_Asym_Pause);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        } else {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 如果驱动不支持暂停或不对称暂停特性，<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 则将暂停和不对称暂停特性添加到设备支持的特性中<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phydev-&gt;supported |= SUPPORTED_Pause | SUPPORTED_Asym_Pause;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 默认将设备状态设置为READY<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        phydev-&gt;state = PHY_READY;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果驱动提供了probe 函数，执行设备的具体初始化操作<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (phydev-&gt;drv-&gt;probe) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 取消PHY 设备的复位信号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            phy_device_reset(phydev, 0);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            // 调用驱动的probe 函数对设备进行初始化，并获取返回的错误码<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            err = phydev-&gt;drv-&gt;probe(phydev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            if (err) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                // 如果初始化出错，重新设置PHY 设备的复位信号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                phy_device_reset(phydev, 1);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 解锁互斥锁<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        mutex_unlock(&amp;phydev-&gt;lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 返回错误码，0 表示成功，非0 表示失败<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return err;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1720 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1720\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在代码清单232.8 的probe 函数中对PHY 设备进行初始化设置，如配置PHY 寄存器，使能自动协商。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1315\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第233 章网络应用编程基础<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章节我们学习网络应用编程。<\/p>"}]});
